      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}b_{2n-1}&amp;=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\int_{0}^{\\pi}f(x)\\sin 2nxdx=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\left[\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}f(x)\\sin 2nxdx+\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\pi}f(x)\\sin 2nxdx\\right]\\\\&amp;=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\left[-\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{0}f(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-x)\\sin 2n(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-x)dx+\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}f(x+\\frac{\\pi}{2})\\sin 2n(x+\\frac{\\pi}{2})dx\\right]\\\\&amp;=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}f(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-x)\\left(\\sin 2n(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-x)+\\sin 2n(x+\\frac{\\pi}{2})\\right)dx=0.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}b_{2n-1}&amp;=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\int_{0}^{\\pi}f(x)\\sin 2nxdx=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\left[\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}f(x)\\sin 2nxdx+\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\pi}f(x)\\sin 2nxdx\\right]\\\\&amp;=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\left[-\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{0}f(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-x)\\sin 2n(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-x)dx+\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}f(x+\\frac{\\pi}{2})\\sin 2n(x+\\frac{\\pi}{2})dx\\right]\\\\&amp;=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}f(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-x)\\left(\\sin 2n(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-x)+\\sin 2n(x+\\frac{\\pi}{2})\\right)dx=0.\\end{aligned}</div>"
