      "answer": "B",
      "answer_index": 1,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned} &amp; \\text{解由于} f(x+2\\pi)=\\operatorname{sgn}(\\cos(x+2\\pi))=\\operatorname{sgn}(\\cos x)=f(x), \\text{所以} f(x)=\\operatorname{sgn}(\\cos x) \\text{是以} \\\\ &amp; \\quad2\\pi \\text{为周期的周期函数，且} f(x) \\text{是偶函数，所以} b_{n}=0,n=1,2,\\cdots, \\\\ &amp; \\quad a_{0}=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\int_{0}^{\\pi}\\operatorname{sgn}(\\cos x)dx=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\left[\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}dx-\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\pi}dx\\right]=0\\,, \\\\ &amp; \\quad a_{n}=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\int_{0}^{\\pi}\\operatorname{sgn}(\\cos x)\\cos n x dx=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\left[\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\cos n x dx-\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\pi}\\cos n x dx\\right] \\\\ &amp; \\quad=\\frac{4}{n\\pi}\\sin\\frac{n\\pi}{2}=\\begin{cases} 0, &amp; n=2k \\\\ (-1)^{k}\\frac{4}{(2k+1)\\pi}, &amp; n=2k+1\\end{cases}, k=0,1,2,\\cdots \\\\ &amp; \\text{所以} f(x) \\text{的傅里叶展式为} \\frac{4}{\\pi}\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}(-1)^{n}\\frac{\\cos(2n+1)x}{2n+1}\\,.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned} &amp; \\text{解由于} f(x+2\\pi)=\\operatorname{sgn}(\\cos(x+2\\pi))=\\operatorname{sgn}(\\cos x)=f(x), \\text{所以} f(x)=\\operatorname{sgn}(\\cos x) \\text{是以} \\\\ &amp; \\quad2\\pi \\text{为周期的周期函数，且} f(x) \\text{是偶函数，所以} b_{n}=0,n=1,2,\\cdots, \\\\ &amp; \\quad a_{0}=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\int_{0}^{\\pi}\\operatorname{sgn}(\\cos x)dx=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\left[\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}dx-\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\pi}dx\\right]=0\\,, \\\\ &amp; \\quad a_{n}=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\int_{0}^{\\pi}\\operatorname{sgn}(\\cos x)\\cos n x dx=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\left[\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\cos n x dx-\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\pi}\\cos n x dx\\right] \\\\ &amp; \\quad=\\frac{4}{n\\pi}\\sin\\frac{n\\pi}{2}=\\begin{cases} 0, &amp; n=2k \\\\ (-1)^{k}\\frac{4}{(2k+1)\\pi}, &amp; n=2k+1\\end{cases}, k=0,1,2,\\cdots \\\\ &amp; \\text{所以} f(x) \\text{的傅里叶展式为} \\frac{4}{\\pi}\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}(-1)^{n}\\frac{\\cos(2n+1)x}{2n+1}\\,.\\end{aligned}</div>"
