      "answer": "C",
      "answer_index": 2,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{解函数}f(x) \\text{是以}2\\pi \\text{为周期的周期函数，且为偶函数，所以}b_n=0,n=1,2,\\cdots,\\\\&amp;a_0=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\int_0^\\pi \\arcsin(\\cos x)dx=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\left[x\\arcsin(\\cos x)|_0^\\pi-\\int_0^\\pi x\\frac{-\\sin x}{\\sqrt{1-\\cos^2 x}}dx\\right]=0\\,,\\\\&amp;a_n=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\int_0^\\pi \\arcsin(\\cos x)\\cos nxdx=\\frac{2}{n\\pi}\\left[\\arcsin(\\cos x)\\sin nx|_0^\\pi-\\int_0^\\pi \\frac{-\\sin x}{\\sqrt{1-\\cos^2 x}}\\sin nxdx\\right]\\\\&amp;=\\frac{2}{n\\pi}\\int_0^\\pi \\sin nxdx=\\frac{2}{n^2\\pi}(1-(-1)^n)=\\begin{cases}0,&amp;n=2k\\\\ \\frac{4}{(2k+1)^2\\pi},&amp;n=2k+1,k=0,1,2,\\cdots\\end{cases}\\\\&amp;\\text{所以所以}f(x) \\text{的傅里叶展式为}\\frac{4}{\\pi}\\sum_{n=0}^\\infty \\frac{\\cos(2n+1)x}{(2n+1)^2}.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{解函数}f(x) \\text{是以}2\\pi \\text{为周期的周期函数，且为偶函数，所以}b_n=0,n=1,2,\\cdots,\\\\&amp;a_0=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\int_0^\\pi \\arcsin(\\cos x)dx=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\left[x\\arcsin(\\cos x)|_0^\\pi-\\int_0^\\pi x\\frac{-\\sin x}{\\sqrt{1-\\cos^2 x}}dx\\right]=0\\,,\\\\&amp;a_n=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\int_0^\\pi \\arcsin(\\cos x)\\cos nxdx=\\frac{2}{n\\pi}\\left[\\arcsin(\\cos x)\\sin nx|_0^\\pi-\\int_0^\\pi \\frac{-\\sin x}{\\sqrt{1-\\cos^2 x}}\\sin nxdx\\right]\\\\&amp;=\\frac{2}{n\\pi}\\int_0^\\pi \\sin nxdx=\\frac{2}{n^2\\pi}(1-(-1)^n)=\\begin{cases}0,&amp;n=2k\\\\ \\frac{4}{(2k+1)^2\\pi},&amp;n=2k+1,k=0,1,2,\\cdots\\end{cases}\\\\&amp;\\text{所以所以}f(x) \\text{的傅里叶展式为}\\frac{4}{\\pi}\\sum_{n=0}^\\infty \\frac{\\cos(2n+1)x}{(2n+1)^2}.\\end{aligned}</div>"
